@{ViewData["Title"]="Reservation information and privacy";}<div class="page-content"><h1>RESERVATION INFORMATION</h1><p>Account and reservation forms collect your name, email, contact number, selected services, attendance count, and booking details to manage your reservation request.</p><p>Your account-linked reservations are available to you and authorized venue staff. Email messages support account verification, password recovery, and reservation updates.</p><p>For questions about your information, contact <a href="mailto:holeinhub@gmail.com">holeinhub@gmail.com</a>. Venue-approved retention terms and a complete privacy policy are required before production launch.</p></div>